Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 13:54:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [FlyWeb] 3.1.4: adapt 3.1.5/chromium/0018 to M156
 IsValidTransferToken(origin)

In 156 IsValidTransferToken() takes the expected url::Origin; the
StorageKey overload (625dedb4a0, crbug 508285208) is not in the 156.
Pass storage_key.origin(), as the two other callers in this file do.
Same change LOCAL-19 made on local/314 (6a30d8feb0) to compile build 47.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MwmK2kcWn812GmYVA1oi3u
---
 .../file_system_access/file_system_access_manager_impl.cc       | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/content/browser/file_system_access/file_system_access_manager_impl.cc b/content/browser/file_system_access/file_system_access_manager_impl.cc
index 8730a97f8..5eb8b68dd 100644
--- a/content/browser/file_system_access/file_system_access_manager_impl.cc
+++ b/content/browser/file_system_access/file_system_access_manager_impl.cc
@@ -1322,7 +1322,7 @@ void FileSystemAccessManagerImpl::DidResolveForSerializeHandle(
   DCHECK_CALLED_ON_VALID_SEQUENCE(sequence_checker_);
 
   if (!resolved_token || resolved_token->origin().opaque() ||
-      !IsValidTransferToken(resolved_token, storage_key,
+      !IsValidTransferToken(resolved_token, storage_key.origin(),
                             resolved_token->type())) {
     std::move(callback).Run({});
     return;
